@startuml FestiPlanComponents
title FestiPlan - architecture hexagonale
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor Client
component "Routes FastAPI" as api
interface "Ports entrants" as inbound
component "Cas d'utilisation" as app
component "Domaine\n(entités + règles)" as domain
interface "Ports sortants\n(repositories + notification)" as outbound
component "Adaptateurs\nSQLAlchemy + notification" as adapters
database "SQLite" as db
component "Composition" as wiring

Client --> api
api --> inbound
inbound <|.. app
app --> domain
app --> outbound
outbound <|.. adapters
adapters --> db
wiring ..> app : injecte les adaptateurs

note bottom
  Les couches métier ne dépendent pas des technologies.
end note
@enduml
